"""Approximate a lowercase definite-noun-phrase opening signal.

The main response is on the token ' the': strongest in copular predicates,
moderate after prepositions and object-taking verbs, weak at clause breaks.
Possessives and a few other noun-phrase function words share a smaller
predicate response. Case and leading space matter. A small, separate response covers URL scheme separators.
Only the last two tokens are retained, and documents reset this memory.
