Most letters respond less in running Greek prose than as mathematical symbols.
Superscript digits and digits immediately after ^ are positive too. Bare tabs
respond more after tabs. Administrator names, Chinese enumeration labels and
sibling words form smaller side responses. Ordinary text is predicted as zero.
