self and reflexives, auto-/aut- forms, and several translations get weaker
negative values. The visually similar 白 also gets a smaller response.
Additional weaker matches cover spelling neighbors and words for natural,
custom, spontaneous, mutual, already, and self-related acts. Recent text
distinguishes code self from ordinary self- words, and import-from from
separation phrases such as 'away from'.
Only a bounded text tail is carried, and it resets at each document.
