"""Share-of-a-whole words. The component fires on words that name a part, portion or
proportion of a whole ("portion", "fraction", "percentage", "%", "majority", "half"),
and more strongly on the "of" right after such a word ("a fraction of", "50% of").
Words for an amount, measure or subdivision ("amount of", "range of", "section of") give a
weaker "of"; after words for a kind, a count or a set of things ("one of", "all of",
"kind of", "variety of", "number of") the "of" is slightly negative. Everything else is 0."""

